      "writtenOn": "2024-09-10T11:57:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ajender, few points:\n\n1) What happen if retries exhaust?\n2) Do we know if retrying will actually help to successfuly write, in next retries (DSP is already in bad state) ?\n3) If due to some reason, DSP has not been able to consume the data then from HAL side onError callback should be sent.",
      "parentUuid": "7b18e0f4_9c21c55a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "bbbb9bee3c72be182c61ff4a262e8e206d9ab276",
